 "entities": {},
 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's total exports increased from 15.39 billion euros in 2005 to 16.25 billion euros in 2025.",
  "Exports peaked at 18.34 billion euros in 2006 and had their lowest point at 12.11 billion euros in 2020.",
  "Imports rose more sharply, from 18.15 billion euros in 2005 to 25.10 billion euros in 2025, with a peak of 25.66 billion euros in 2022.",
  "The largest year-to-year change in imports was a drop from 21.86 billion euros in 2008 to 18.16 billion euros in 2009, coinciding with the financial crisis.",
  "All values are nominal and not adjusted for inflation, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
